<script setup>
import { onMounted, onUnmounted, ref } from "vue"; import { api } from "../api";
const runs=ref([]), status=ref(null), loading=ref(true), error=ref("");
async function load(){loading.value=true;error.value="";try{[runs.value,status.value]=await Promise.all([api("/agent-runs"),api("/langfuse/status")]);}catch(e){error.value=e.message;}finally{loading.value=false;}}
onMounted(() => { load(); window.addEventListener("demo-identity-changed", load); }); onUnmounted(() => window.removeEventListener("demo-identity-changed", load));
</script>
<template><div class="page-stack"><section class="welcome-row"><div><div class="eyebrow">TRACE OBSERVABILITY</div><h2>可观测性</h2><p>本地运行记录用于核对身份范围；Langfuse 只有开启并配置后才会接收结构化 Trace。</p></div><button class="button button-secondary" @click="load">↻ 刷新</button></section><div v-if="loading" class="state-card">正在读取 Trace 状态…</div><div v-else-if="error" class="state-card state-error">{{error}}</div><template v-else><section class="content-card langfuse-status"><div class="langfuse-mark">L</div><div class="langfuse-info"><h3>Langfuse 集成</h3><p v-if="status.enabled">已配置 · Agent Trace 将按后端脱敏设置导出。</p><p v-else-if="status.reason==='missing_credentials'">启用开关已打开，但后端密钥尚未完整配置；当前不会发送数据。</p><p v-else>未启用 · 核心 Agent 继续正常工作，事件仅保存在本次响应和本地运行记录中。</p><small>输入/输出字段在导出前脱敏；密钥只由后端环境读取。当前 SDK 要求 Langfuse Cloud 或自托管 v4.59+。</small></div><span class="status-pill" :class="status.enabled?'status-completed':'status-idle'">{{status.enabled?'已启用':'未启用'}}</span></section><section class="content-card"><div class="section-heading"><div><h3>本地 Agent 运行记录</h3><p>只显示当前认证用户、当前租户的运行。</p></div></div><div v-if="!runs.length" class="empty-inline">暂无运行记录。</div><div v-else class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>Intent</th><th>状态</th><th>Trace ID</th><th>Thread / Run</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in runs" :key="r.run_id"><td>{{new Date(r.started_at).toLocaleString()}}</td><td>{{r.intent||"—"}}</td><td><span class="status-pill">{{r.status}}</span></td><td class="mono trace-id">{{r.trace_id}}</td><td class="mono">{{r.run_id}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="metric-note"><span class="notice-icon">i</span><div><strong>目前没有可验证的 Token 用量或 Langfuse Trace 查询</strong><p>本地 schema 未保存这些字段。若启用 Langfuse，Trace 内容会依照后端脱敏策略导出；本地页面只展示自己可访问的运行记录。</p></div></section></template></div></template>
